TI  - Failure of physiological transformation and spiral artery atherosis: their roles in preeclampsia.
AU  - Staff, Anne Cathrine
AU  - Fjeldstad, Heidi E
AU  - Fosheim, Ingrid Knutsdotter
AU  - Moe, Kjartan
AU  - Turowski, Gitta
AU  - Johnsen, Guro Mørk
