TI  - Maternal cardiovascular-related single nucleotide polymorphisms, genes, and pathways associated with early-onset preeclampsia.
AU  - Benny, Paula
AU  - Yamasato, Kelly
AU  - Yunits, Breck
AU  - Zhu, Xun
AU  - Ching, Travers
AU  - Garmire, Lana X
AU  - Berry, Marla J
